('Atreus [FWL]', -191.068, -163.776, 'Free Worlds League', 'Atreus is the capital world of the Free Worlds League. The system’s habitable world, Atreus III, was colonized in 2160 during the First Exodus from Terra and became the League capital in 2271. It is an important political and industrial center, with defense-industry facilities and the capital city of Atreus City. The moon Wendigo is notable as the location of the headquarters of SAFE, the Free Worlds League intelligence agency. This entry refers to the Free Worlds League system, not the separate Clan Homeworlds system also named Atreus.', 'earth.png'),
