('Luthien', 167.621, 250.493, 'Draconis Combine', 'Luthien is the capital world of the Draconis Combine and the seat of House Kurita. Originally a lightly populated farming world settled in 2276, it became strategically important as the Combine expanded. By the Clan Invasion era it was a major industrial center: Luthien Armor Works operated extensive BattleMech production facilities, while the planet also housed the Kurita family and important military infrastructure. The system’s moons include Tsu Shima, Orientalis, Hikisaku, and Occidentalis; an aerospace fighter base was located on Orientalis in 3052.', 'forest.png'),
