('New Avalon', 266.497, -110.836, 'Federated Commonwealth (Federated Suns-aligned)', 'New Avalon is the capital world of the Federated Suns and the fourth planet of its system. First explored by the Terran Alliance ship TAS Camelot in 2205, the world attracted settlers because of its verdant environment and pleasant climate. It became the Federated Suns’ capital in the twenty-fourth century and developed into a heavily populated, industrialized center. New Avalon is home to major defense corporations, military academies, and the institutions of House Davion’s government.', 'earth.png'),
