('Sol [Terra, Luna, Mars]', 0.0, 0.0, 'ComStar', 'The Sol system contains Terra, humanity’s ancestral home, along with inhabited Venus and Mars and numerous other worlds and facilities. Terra is known as the cradle of civilization and has served as the capital of several interstellar powers. After the fall of the Star League and the collapse of the Terran Hegemony, ComStar secured control of the system, preserving advanced Star League technology and military assets while operating the Inner Sphere’s hyperpulse generator network. In 3052, the system is recorded under ComStar control.', 'earth.png'),
('Solaris [Solaris VII]', -122.316, -7.025, 'Federated Commonwealth (Lyran-aligned)', 'The Solaris system lies near the historic border between the Lyran Commonwealth and the Free Worlds League. It contains twelve planets, with Solaris IV and Solaris VII among the inhabited worlds. Solaris VII is famous throughout the Inner Sphere as the Game World, where BattleMech duels developed into the celebrated Solaris Games. The tradition grew from demonstrations by competing BattleMech manufacturers and later became a major spectator sport, attracting gamblers, mercenaries, and MechWarriors seeking fame. The system’s 3052 affiliation in SUCKit is Federated Commonwealth, Lyran-aligned.', 'earth.png'),
