('Tharkad', -212.999, 151.773, 'Federated Commonwealth (Lyran-aligned)', 'Tharkad is the capital world of the Lyran Commonwealth. Discovered in 2310, it was developed into a cold-weather world with imported Terran flora and fauna, giving parts of its environment a distinctly arctic character. It became the Commonwealth capital in 2407. The planet is known for rugged, icy terrain and major political and military institutions, including the governmental complex known as the Triad and the Lyran military command center at Asgard. In 3052 it was the central seat of Lyran Commonwealth government.', 'forest.png'),
