('Tukayyid', -4.431, 210.42, 'Free Rasalhague Republic', 'Tukayyid was primarily an agricultural world in the Free Rasalhague Republic when the Clan Invasion reached its climax. In May 3052, ComStar’s Com Guards fought the seven invading Clans across fourteen objectives in a proxy battle whose outcome would determine the fate of Terra. The Com Guards won after twenty-one days of fighting, triggering the fifteen-year Truce of Tukayyid and halting the Clans’ advance toward Terra. The battle made Tukayyid one of the defining worlds of the Clan Invasion era.', 'dust.png'),
