('Atreus [C]', 71.811, 1734.247, 'ComStar', 'This is the separate Atreus system in the Clan Homeworlds, not the Free Worlds League capital system. The Clans colonized it during the Golden Century. In 3052, the system was divided between Clan Smoke Jaguar, holding approximately sixty percent, and Clan Fire Mandrill, holding approximately forty percent. The system was subsequently abandoned by the Clans, but in the Clan Invasion era it remained part of the Deep Periphery political landscape.', 'earth.png'),
